From: Robertas Tumas <robertas.t@8devices.com>
Subject: [PATCH] image: record the overlay patches in the CycloneDX SBOM

The SBOM written by Build/mkfs (JSON_CYCLONEDX_SBOM) lists every package
with its upstream version. The 8devices overlay changes some of those
packages with quilt series applied before the build, which the version can
never show: base-files keeps the upstream commit count, luci-* keep the
upstream luci commit, so the SBOM claims pristine upstream for content
that differs.

CycloneDX has the construct for exactly this: a component "pedigree"
whose "patches" list declares that the component is upstream plus the
given diffs. After the SBOM is generated, run the overlay's
sbom-pedigree.py (8devices/scripts/, only when present, so an
ImageBuilder or a tree without the overlay is unaffected). It reads the
applied quilt series (8devices/.pc/<series>/applied-patches, or the
whole series file when there is no quilt state), maps every +++ path of
every patch to the package owning it via .packageinfo (feed packages
through their package/feeds symlink), and adds a pedigree with the patch
paths to those components. Patches that touch no package (tools, build
system, image recipes) are recorded on metadata.component, the firmware
image itself. The Kiwi board file the overlay installs (data, not a
patch) gets a pedigree note with its md5 on ipq-wifi-8devices_kiwi. The
script is idempotent and leaves the rest of the SBOM untouched.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Robertas Tumas <robertas.t@8devices.com>
---
 include/image.mk | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/image.mk b/include/image.mk
index f65a835a1a..1839ba6831 100644
--- a/include/image.mk
+++ b/include/image.mk
@@ -353,6 +353,10 @@ ifneq ($(CONFIG_JSON_CYCLONEDX_SBOM),)
 		$(if $(IB),$(TOPDIR)/.packageinfo, $(TMP_DIR)/.packageinfo) \
 		$(BIN_DIR)/$(IMG_PREFIX)$(if $(PROFILE_SANITIZED),-$(PROFILE_SANITIZED)).manifest > \
 		$(BIN_DIR)/$(IMG_PREFIX)$(if $(PROFILE_SANITIZED),-$(PROFILE_SANITIZED)).bom.cdx.json
+	$(if $(wildcard $(TOPDIR)/8devices/scripts/sbom-pedigree.py), \
+		$(TOPDIR)/8devices/scripts/sbom-pedigree.py --overlay $(TOPDIR)/8devices \
+			--packageinfo $(if $(IB),$(TOPDIR)/.packageinfo, $(TMP_DIR)/.packageinfo) \
+			$(BIN_DIR)/$(IMG_PREFIX)$(if $(PROFILE_SANITIZED),-$(PROFILE_SANITIZED)).bom.cdx.json)
 endif
 endef
 
